{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"哈萨克斯坦","country_iso":"KAZ","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:53:19.185272","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"KAZ-HB-0008","ldc":"No","location":"库斯塔奈","location_norm":"科斯塔奈州","name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"哈萨克斯坦库斯塔奈1GW风电+600MWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Kazakhstan 1GW Wind + 600MWh BESS Project (Kostanay)","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"寰泰能源","content":"4月15日，哈萨克斯坦2025年可再生能源项目招投标首轮竞拍举行，寰泰能源成功中标1GW风电项目及600MWh配套储能系统，进一步稳固公司在中亚新能源市场的领先地位。\n寰泰能源哈萨克Ybyrai 50MW风电项目资料图\n此次竞拍由哈萨克斯坦能源部组织举办，是哈萨克斯坦首次推出“风电+储能”一体化项目竞标，共释放1个总装机容量为1GW的风电项目及配套储能系统在线竞拍，项目地位于哈萨克斯坦北部库斯塔奈。项目建成后，预计年发电量可达约39亿度，每年减少碳排放390万吨；配套建设的储能系统将有效平衡风电波动性，提升电网稳定性。\n投标过程中，共有四家新能源企业参与竞争，各家企业累计提交了20份报价方案。经过激烈角逐，寰泰能源最终成功中标该1GW风电项目及600MWh配套储能系统。\n寰泰能源董事长、总裁南逸表示,此次成功中标进一步体现了公司在海外新能源市场的国际竞争力。我们将充分发挥在新能源电力、储能技术等领域的全产业链优势，高标准、高质量推进项目建设，力争打造中亚地区“新能源+储能”一体化标杆工程，为哈萨克斯坦乃至整个中亚的能源结构优化贡献力量。\n至此，寰泰能源在哈萨克斯坦并网、已建、待建新能源项目共计17个，总规模近2GW，成为中亚最大、最具竞争力的清洁能源供应商。","content_sha256":"43bff80a17b6b9e133390735b2f7540580e518363d7da0cb46ec23302296853e","id":3997,"publish_date":"2025-04-18 09:51:03","title":"寰泰能源中标哈萨克斯坦1GW风电项目+600MWh配套储能","title_sha256":"4e11a94e34c4efdbc74055009a700710b5d9b775ca569cbaffe45e4175786433","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/81628.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"KAZ-HB-0008","capacity_details":"PV: 1000MW, BESS: 600MWh","capacity_mw":1000.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"1000","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:53:19.185680","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"KAZ-HB-0008-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.universalenergy.com/project-cases/17\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"寰泰能源股份有限公司","project_developer_en":"Universal Energy","project_stage":"中标","project_summary":"中国企业寰泰能源在哈萨克斯坦中标一个1GW的风电项目及600MWh的配套储能系统。该项目位于哈萨克斯坦北部库斯塔奈，是哈萨克斯坦首次推出的“风电+储能”一体化项目竞标，目前处于中标阶段。","publish_date":"2025-04-18 09:51:03","pv_capacity_mw":1000.0,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/81628.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":600.0,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"KAZ-HB-0008","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["active_hybrid_category","existing_storage_numeric","storage_text_signal"]}
